      <description><![CDATA[
        <h3>What's new in 1.1.2</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Fixed connecting an iOS Simulator setting the system proxy on the wrong (inactive) network service — it now targets the interface actually in use, so simulator traffic is captured reliably.</li>
          <li>Cleaner connect UI — disconnect is now inline on the active simulator row.</li>
          <li>Stability improvements.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
